# packages installed outside a requirements file. It may only FALL: move installs into a pinned
# requirements file (for a manifest: bake them into an image built from one), then lower it
# (scripts/check-dockerfile-installs.sh --write-baseline). <path>\t<count>; zero rows are omitted.
